{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE0.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE2-E.png?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE1.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE4-E.png?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/BATTLE-30.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE6-E.png?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/OutSide.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE8-E.png?t=1745285452\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>FrostBound</i></strong> is a tower defense card rogue game set in an endless, frigid winter. Take charge as you construct your garrison, explore the environment, gather resources, and fend off enemies that surge like a tidal wave. Create defenses you never thought possible from a vast card pool of over 500 cards, forging unprecedented battlefield synergies to turn the tide of battle, preserve the flame of civilization, and put an end to this endless winter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BRAND NEW GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemy is advancing towards us. We must defend our fortress at all costs and not let the enemy pass the leftmost line of defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose to attack or deploy troops in each round. It should be noted that the severe cold environment will cause the soldiers to withdraw after one round. Only solid buildings and powerful units can stand on the battlefield and continue to fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIFFERENT EXPERIENCE EACH ROUND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge mixed card pool of <strong>more than 500 cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 major schools with their own characteristics, combined together to exert unexpected abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique elite card mechanism, experience the fun of growth in every battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 powerful starting heroes, each with his own unique skills to help you fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 100 buildings</strong>, bringing overall improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 80 enemies</strong>, can you resist the oppressive disaster</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BREAK THE CURSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Civilization is frozen at this moment, the mysterious old man, the entanglement of different schools, the alienated enemies... The truth of the world is waiting for you to solve!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649580?t=1745285452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/5cb897718a78cfd55cda60f651120ea38938a157/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745285452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/6a15191b1060c1148677e879a558238a60cfcb4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745285452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/6a15191b1060c1148677e879a558238a60cfcb4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745285452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE0.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE2-E.png?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE1.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/SCENE4-E.png?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649580/extras/BATTLE-30.gif?t=1745285452\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share